{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_plans_handoff_08072026_grant_hygiene_bug_class", "label": "Grant-hygiene bug class (revoke PUBLIC not named roles)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/plans/handoff_08072026.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Revoking a named role is a no-op if PUBLIC or a schema-wide ALTER DEFAULT PRIVILEGES still holds the grant; must revoke from public and re-check pg_proc.proacl. Recurred four times across sprints."}, {"id": "docs_plans_handoff_08072026_migration_filename_drift", "label": "Migration filename drift (apply_migration)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/plans/handoff_08072026.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Supabase MCP apply_migration assigns the remote version from server time, ignoring the local filename; each of Sprint 2's 10 migrations needed a post-apply list_migrations rename. Sprint 3a reverted to CLI db push to avoid the class."}, {"id": "docs_plans_handoff_08072026_self_checkin_bruteforce_regression", "label": "Self-check-in brute-force rate-limit regression", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/plans/handoff_08072026.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Per-IP\u2192per-event rate-limit switch let invalid codes return before any rate-limit ran, removing brute-force protection; fixed by IP-limiting the guess path specifically without reintroducing the venue-NAT problem."}, {"id": "docs_plans_handoff_08072026_audit_insert_last", "label": "Audit-insert-last convention", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/plans/handoff_08072026.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_plans_handoff_08072026_d1_audit_authenticity", "label": "D1 \u2014 write_audit_event